{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmzJ9P9ZVU3wTWFrwCvc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'd tell a friend:** Harel has loads: 96 tracks across 7 products, plus 5 קרנות מחקות and 4 קרנות סל. The S&P 500 ones are what I'd go for. In קופת גמל להשקעה and קרן השתלמות the S&P track takes about 0.5–0.56% \"מהחיסכון\" and made \"13.7%\" over 3 years. Harel's קרן מחקה S&P 500 looks cheaper at \"0.1%\", but it shows no returns at all. Fairly sure, but not fully. What decided it: the S&P rows are the only ones where I saw high numbers next to a name I know.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page:** I saw \"הראל\", \"כל המוצרים של הראל\", \"105\" and the product buttons. Good, it's the right page.\n- **The big table:** I scrolled through קופת גמל להשקעה, קרן השתלמות, תגמולים, חיסכון לכל ילד, קרן חדשה מקיפה, קרן חדשה כללית and מרכזית לפיצויים.\n  - I stopped on \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" each time it came up. In גמל להשקעה it was 0.56% and \"13.7% 3 שנים\". In השתלמות it was 0.5% and \"13.71%\".\n  - \"מניות\" in השתלמות shows \"21.45%\", which is higher. That made me wonder.\n  - From around the third screen I was just skimming pension stuff. 1.47% \"מההפקדות\" in קרן חדשה looked big. I wouldn't really have read that far on my phone.\n- **קרנות מחקות / קרנות סל at the bottom:** \"הראל מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\" shows \"קבועים 0%\", \"משתנים 0.1%\", \"נאמן 0.025%\". The קרן סל S&P is \"קבועים 0.6%\", which seems pricier.\n- **What I skipped:** the grey notes (PF-06, PF-10), the paragraph about \"התשואה היא תשואה עבר\", and the \"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\" folds.\n\n**What annoyed me:**\n- Every row repeats \"מניות / מט\"ח\", \"מהחיסכון / מההפקדות\" and \"3 שנים / 5 שנים\". I kept re-reading the same words just to find the number that changes.\n- Lots of rows just say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" with no number.\n- The funds at the bottom show no returns, so I can't compare them with the tracks.\n- Words I didn't get: \"נאמן\", \"צוברת\", \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"חשיפה לדולר\", \"מס נגדי על שינויי המטבע\", \"4A/4D\", \"ההפקדות\" vs \"החיסכון\", and \"קבועים/משתנים\".\n- I'm not sure \"13.7%\" is per year. I read it as yearly, going by the column header \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\".\n- I still don't know what to actually do first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7775,"cache_read_input_tokens":18601,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7775},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"014bc8e0-08c9-4824-ba40-55eb6f6ec282","uuid":"b57e9a0f-314d-4d96-bdc0-40402bf8a13f","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:27:36.917Z","request_id":"req_011CgmzJ99GS5kfFogZLqY57"}
